  "releaseNotes": "[AutofacTest] now works alongside [TestCaseSource] and [TestCase], so data-driven tests get a fresh injected driver per row. Declare the driver parameter anywhere with a null placeholder in each row, or last as an optional parameter omitted from the rows. [Values]/[Range]/[Random] remain unsupported and now report a clear message instead of silently building no cases.",
